xx , lam ) end if end associate ! carry the working set over to the original constraints do c = 1 , eq % mr id = eq % keep ( c ) eq % other % sense ( id ) = ior ( iand ( eq % other % sense ( id ), not ( state_mask )), & iand ( work % sense ( c ), state_mask )) end do end associate end subroutine daqp_eq_expand","tags":"","url":"proc/daqp_eq_expand.html"},{"title":"daqp_eq_set_primal_start – daqp-fortran","text":"public  subroutine daqp_eq_set_primal_start(work, x) Set the starting iterate of the reduced problem from x of the original one. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: x (:) iterate of the original problem Calls proc~~daqp_eq_set_primal_start~~CallsGraph proc~daqp_eq_set_primal_start daqp_eq_set_primal_start proc~eq_hess_times eq_hess_times proc~daqp_eq_set_primal_start->proc~eq_hess_times proc~eq_dot eq_dot proc~eq_hess_times->proc~eq_dot Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~daqp_eq_set_primal_start~~CalledByGraph proc~daqp_eq_set_primal_start daqp_eq_set_primal_start proc~daqp_set_primal_start daqp_set_primal_start proc~daqp_set_primal_start->proc~daqp_eq_set_primal_start proc~daqp_setup daqp_setup proc~daqp_setup->proc~daqp_set_primal_start proc~set_primal_start daqp_type%set_primal_start proc~set_primal_start->proc~daqp_set_primal_start proc~daqp_quadprog daqp_quadprog proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_setup proc~setup daqp_type%setup 