nknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~form_r~~CalledByGraph proc~form_r form_R proc~update_r update_R proc~update_r->proc~form_r proc~retry_avi_with_reduced_rho retry_avi_with_reduced_rho proc~retry_avi_with_reduced_rho->proc~update_r proc~update_ldp_core update_ldp_core proc~update_ldp_core->proc~update_r proc~update_r_qp update_R_qp proc~update_ldp_core->proc~update_r_qp proc~update_r_qp->proc~update_r proc~daqp_solve_avi daqp_solve_avi proc~daqp_solve_avi->proc~retry_avi_with_reduced_rho proc~daqp_solve_avi->proc~daqp_solve_avi proc~daqp_update_ldp daqp_update_ldp proc~daqp_update_ldp->proc~update_ldp_core proc~daqp_setup daqp_setup proc~daqp_setup->proc~daqp_update_ldp proc~daqp_solve daqp_solve proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_solve_avi proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_update_ldp proc~update daqp_type%update proc~update->proc~daqp_update_ldp proc~daqp_quadprog daqp_quadprog proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_setup proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_solve proc~setup daqp_type%setup proc~setup->proc~daqp_setup proc~solve daqp_type%solve proc~solve->proc~daqp_solve proc~daqp_avi daqp_avi proc~daqp_avi->proc~daqp_quadprog Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a sub