ion extract_lower_flag","tags":"","url":"proc/extract_lower_flag.html"},{"title":"binary_diff – daqp-fortran","text":"private  function binary_diff(work, id) result(diff) Signed distance of binary constraint id from the midpoint of its bounds. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(in) :: work workspace integer(kind=ip), intent(in) :: id constraint Return Value real(kind=wp) Calls proc~~binary_diff~~CallsGraph proc~binary_diff binary_diff proc~ridx~2 ridx proc~binary_diff->proc~ridx~2 Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~binary_diff~~CalledByGraph proc~binary_diff binary_diff proc~get_branch_id get_branch_id proc~get_branch_id->proc~binary_diff proc~daqp_bnb daqp_bnb proc~daqp_bnb->proc~get_branch_id proc~daqp_solve daqp_solve proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_bnb proc~daqp_quadprog daqp_quadprog proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_solve proc~solve daqp_type%solve proc~solve->proc~daqp_solve proc~daqp_avi daqp_avi proc~daqp_avi->proc~daqp_quadprog Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code real ( wp ) function binary_diff ( work , id ) result ( diff ) type ( daqp_workspace ), intent ( in ) :: work !! workspace integer ( ip ), intent ( in ) :: id !! constraint integer ( ip ) :: j , disp diff = 0.5_wp * ( work % dupper ( id ) + work % dlower ( id )) if ( id <= work % ms ) then ! simple bound if ( work % rmode /= rinv_dense ) then ! Hessian is identity (or diagonal) diff = diff - work % x ( id ) else disp = ridx ( id , id , work % n ) do j = id , work % n diff = diff - work % R ( disp ) * work % x ( j ) disp = disp + 1 end do end if else ! general bound (add_infeasible already computed M*u) diff = diff - work % Mu ( id - work % ms ) end if end function binary_diff","tags":"","url":"proc/binary_diff.html"},{"title":"bnb_store_ws – daqp-fortran","text":"private  function bnb_store_ws(work, ids) result(n_ids) Store the free part of the working set in ids . Returns the number stored. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(in) :: work workspace integer(kind=ip), intent(inout) :: ids (:) storage Return Value integer(kind=ip) Calls proc~~bnb_store_ws~~CallsGraph proc~bnb_store_ws bnb_store_ws proc~add_lower_flag add_lower_flag proc~bnb_store_ws->proc~add_lower_flag proc~has~2 has proc~bnb_store_ws->proc~has~2 Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~bnb_store_ws~~CalledByGraph proc~bnb_store_