nd if end do end subroutine sub_working_set_rows","tags":"","url":"proc/sub_working_set_rows.html"},{"title":"refine_active – daqp-fortran","text":"private  subroutine refine_active(work) One step of iterative refinement for the active constraints: solve LDL' dlam = r with the residuals r = M_W u - d_W , and update lam_star += dlam , u -= M_W' dlam . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace Calls proc~~refine_active~~CallsGraph proc~refine_active refine_active proc~dot_seq dot_seq proc~refine_active->proc~dot_seq proc~has~2 has proc~refine_active->proc~has~2 proc~ridx~2 ridx proc~refine_active->proc~ridx~2 proc~soft_penalty soft_penalty proc~refine_active->proc~soft_penalty proc~soft_residual soft_residual proc~refine_active->proc~soft_residual proc~solve_working_set solve_working_set proc~refine_active->proc~solve_working_set proc~sub_working_set_rows sub_working_set_rows proc~refine_active->proc~sub_working_set_rows proc~soft_penalty->proc~has~2 proc~soft_rho soft_rho proc~soft_penalty->proc~soft_rho proc~soft_w soft_w proc~soft_penalty->proc~soft_w proc~soft_residual->proc~has~2 proc~soft_residual->proc~soft_rho proc~soft_residual->proc~soft_w proc~lidx~2 lidx proc~solve_working_set->proc~lidx~2 proc~sub_working_set_rows->proc~ridx~2 proc~soft_rho->proc~has~2 proc~soft_w->proc~has~2 Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~refine_active~~CalledByGraph proc~refine_active refine_active proc~daqp_ldp daqp_ldp proc~daqp_ldp->proc~refine_active proc~daqp_hiqp daqp_hiqp proc~daqp_hiqp->proc~daqp_ldp proc~daqp_prox daqp_prox proc~daqp_prox->proc~daqp_ldp proc~daqp_solve daqp_solve proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_ldp proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_hiqp proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_prox proc~daqp_solve_avi daqp_solve_avi proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_solve_avi proc~daqp_bnb daqp_bnb proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_bnb proc~daqp_solve_avi->proc~daqp_ldp proc~daqp_solve_avi->proc~daqp_solve_avi proc~minrep_work minrep_work proc~minrep_work->proc~daqp_ldp proc~process_node process_node proc~process_node->proc~daqp_ldp proc~daqp_bnb->proc~process_node proc~daqp_minrep daqp_minrep proc~daqp_minrep->proc~minrep_work proc~daqp_quadprog daqp_quadprog proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_solve proc~solve daqp_type%solve proc~solve->proc~daqp_solve proc~daqp_avi daqp_avi proc~daqp_avi->proc~daqp_quadprog Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine refine_active ( work ) type ( daqp_workspace ), intent ( inout ) :: work !! workspace integer ( ip ) :: i , j , k , id , n , na real ( wp ) :: Mu , d , fval n = work % n na = work % n_active ! xldl and zldl are used as scratch, which invalidates the cached CSP work % reuse_ind = 0 ! r(i) = M_i*u - d_i in xldl do i = 1 , na id = work % WS ( i ) if ( id <= work % ms ) then if ( work % rmode == rinv_dense ) then Mu = 0.0_wp k = ridx ( id , id , n ) do j = id , n Mu = Mu + work % R ( k ) * work % x ( j ) k = k + 1 end do else Mu = work % x ( id ) end if else Mu = dot_seq ( n , work % Mr (:, id - work % ms ), work % x ) end if if ( has ( work % sense ( id ), daqp_lower )) then d = work % dlower ( id ) else d = work % dupper ( id ) end if work % xldl ( i ) = Mu - d ! a nonzero soft slack adds a diagonal term to the CSP system if ( has ( work % sense ( id ), daqp_soft ) . and . . not . has ( work % sense ( id ), daqp_slack_fixed )) then work % xldl ( i ) = work % xldl ( i ) - soft_residual ( work , id , work % lam_star ( i )) end if end do call solve_working_set ( work ) ! xldl = dlam do i = 1 , na work % lam_star ( i ) = work % lam_star ( i ) + work % xldl ( i ) end do call sub_working_set_rows ( work , work % xldl , work % x ) ! recompute fval, since both u and lam_star changed fval = 0.0_wp do i = 1 , na id = work % WS ( i ) if ( has ( work % sense ( id ), daqp_soft )) fval = fval + soft_penalty ( work , id , work % lam_star ( i )) end do do j = 1 , n fval = fval + work % x ( j ) * work % x ( j ) end do work % fval = fval end subroutine refine_active","tags":"","url":"proc/refine_active.html"},{"title":"apply_Rinv – daqp-fortran","text":"private  subroutine apply_Rinv(work, y) y <-- Rinv*y (as daqp_ldp2qp_solution , without v ). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(in) :: work workspace real(kind=wp), intent(inout) :: y (:) vector of size n Called by proc~~apply_rinv~~CalledByGraph proc~apply_rinv apply_Rinv proc~daqp_ldp2qp_solution daqp_ldp2qp_solution proc~daqp_ldp2qp_solution->proc~apply_rinv proc~prox_project_step prox_project_step proc~prox_project_step->proc~apply_rinv proc~refine_primal refine_primal proc~refine_primal->proc~apply_rinv proc~daqp_prox daqp_prox proc~daqp_prox->proc~daqp_ldp2qp_solution proc~daqp_prox->proc~prox_project_step proc~daqp_prox->proc~refine_primal proc~prox_step prox_step proc~daqp_prox->proc~prox_step proc~daqp_solve daqp_solve proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_ldp2qp_solution proc~daqp_solve->proc~re