 % scaling ( i ) = scaling_i ! needed to retrieve the solution do j = 0 , n - i work % R ( k + j ) = work % R ( k + j ) * scaling_i end do end do end subroutine normalize_Rinv","tags":"","url":"proc/normalize_rinv.html"},{"title":"unconstrained_cholesky – daqp-fortran","text":"private  subroutine unconstrained_cholesky(work, vs, feasible) Solve R'v = f , R x = -v with the factor R (reciprocal diagonal), for\nthe unconstrained optimum while the inverse is deferred. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace real(kind=wp), intent(inout) :: vs (:) scratch for v (size n ) logical, intent(inout) :: feasible set to false if x is not finite Calls proc~~unconstrained_cholesky~~CallsGraph proc~unconstrained_cholesky unconstrained_cholesky proc~ridx~2 ridx proc~unconstrained_cholesky->proc~ridx~2 Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~unconstrained_cholesky~~CalledByGraph proc~unconstrained_cholesky unconstrained_cholesky proc~check_unconstrained check_unconstrained proc~check_unconstrained->proc~unconstrained_cholesky proc~update_ldp_core update_ldp_core proc~update_ldp_core->proc~check_unconstrained proc~daqp_update_ldp daqp_update_ldp proc~daqp_update_ldp->proc~update_ldp_core proc~daqp_setup daqp_setup proc~daqp_setup->proc~daqp_update_ldp proc~daqp_solve daqp_solve proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_update_ldp proc~update daqp_type%update proc~update->proc~daqp_update_ldp proc~daqp_quadprog daqp_quadprog proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_setup proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_solve proc~setup daqp_type%setup proc~setup->proc~daqp_setup proc~solve daqp_type%solve proc~solve->proc~daqp_solve proc~daqp_avi daqp_avi proc~daqp_avi->proc~daqp_quadprog Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine unconstrained_cholesky ( work , vs , feasible ) type ( daqp_workspace ), intent ( inout ) :: work !! workspace real ( wp ), intent ( inout ) :: vs (:) !! scratch for `v` (size `n`) logical , intent ( inout ) :: feasible !! set to false if `x` is not finite integer ( ip ) :: i , j , k , n , off real ( wp ) :: vi , s n = work % n if ( work % qp % has_f ) then vs ( 1 : n ) = work % qp % f else vs ( 1 : n ) = 0.0_wp end if k = 1 do i = 1 , n ! (row-wise, to traverse R contiguously) vs ( i ) = vs ( i ) * work % R ( k ) vi = vs ( i ) k = k + 1 do j = i + 1 , n vs ( j ) = vs ( j ) - work % R ( k ) * vi k = k + 1 end do end do do i = n , 1 , - 1 s = - vs ( i ) off = ridx ( i , i , n ) do j = i + 1 , n s = s - work % R ( off + j - i ) * work % x ( j ) end do work % x ( i ) = s * work % R ( off ) if (. not . ieee_is_finite ( work % x ( i ))) feasible = . false . end do end subroutine unconstrained_cholesky","tags":"","url":"proc/unconstrained_cholesky.html"},{"title":"prox_rescale – daqp-fortran","text":"private  subroutine prox_rescale(work, eps, eps_new) Change eps of the semi-proximal directions to eps_new (only their\ncolumns of Rinv and M are scaled; the working set has to be refactored\nafterwards). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: eps current regularization real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: eps_new new regularization Calls proc~~prox_rescale~~CallsGraph proc~prox_rescale prox_rescale proc~has~2 has proc~prox_rescale->proc~has~2 proc~ridx~2 ridx proc~prox_rescale->proc~ridx~2 Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~prox_rescale~~CalledByGraph proc~prox_rescale prox_rescale proc~daqp_prox daqp_prox proc~daqp_prox->proc~prox_rescale proc~daqp_solve daqp_solve proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_prox proc~daqp_quadprog daqp_quadprog proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_solve proc~solve daqp_type%solve proc~solve->proc~daqp_solve proc~daqp_avi daqp_avi proc~daqp_avi->proc~daqp_quadprog Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine prox_rescale ( work , eps , eps_new ) type ( daqp_workspace ), intent ( inout ) :: work !! workspace real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: eps !! current regularization real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: eps_new !! new regularization integer ( ip ) :: i , j , k , n , ms real ( wp ) :: r , norm2 , sc n = work % n ms = work % ms do i = 1 , n if (. not . work % prox_mask ( i )) cycle r = sqrt (( work % qp % Hc ( i , i ) + eps ) / ( work % qp % Hc ( i , i ) + eps_new )) if ( work % rmode /= rinv_dense ) then work % R ( i ) = work % R ( i ) * r if ( i <= ms ) work % scaling ( i ) = work % scaling ( i ) / r else if ( i <= ms . and . has ( work % state , state_rinv_normalized )) then work % scaling ( i ) = work % scaling ( i ) / r else work % R ( ridx ( i , i , n )) = work % R ( ridx ( i , i , n )) * r end if end do do i = ms + 1 , work % m k = i - ms norm2 = 1.0_wp do j = 1 , n if (. not . work % prox_mask ( j ) . or . work % Mr ( j , k ) == 0.0_wp ) cycle r = sqrt (( work % qp % Hc ( j , j ) + eps ) / ( work % qp % Hc ( j , j ) + eps_new )) norm2 = norm2 + ( r * r - 1.0_wp ) * work % Mr ( j , k ) * work % Mr ( j , k ) work % Mr ( j , k ) = work % Mr ( j , k ) * r end do if ( norm2 == 1.0_wp ) cycle sc = 1.0_wp / sqrt ( norm2 ) do j = 1 , n work % Mr ( j , k ) = work % Mr ( j , k ) * sc end do work % scaling ( i ) = work % scaling ( i ) * sc end do end subroutine prox_rescale","tags":"","url":"proc/prox_rescale.html"},{"title":"daqp_destroy – daqp-fortran","text":"public  subroutine daqp_destroy(work) Deallocate the workspace (the settings are kept). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace Called by proc~~daqp_destroy~~CalledByGraph proc~daqp_destroy daqp_destroy proc~daqp_quadprog daqp_quadprog proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_destroy proc~daqp_setup daqp_setup proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_setup proc~daqp_setup->proc~daqp_destroy proc~destroy daqp_type%destroy proc~destroy->proc~daqp_destroy proc~daqp_avi daqp_avi proc~daqp_avi->proc~daqp_quadprog proc~setup daqp_type%