es which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine transpose_into ( A , B ) real ( wp ), intent ( in ) :: A (:,:) !! `(p,q)` real ( wp ), intent ( out ) :: B (:,:) !! `(q,p)` integer ( ip ), parameter :: nb = 32 integer ( ip ) :: i , j , i0 , j0 do j0 = 1 , size ( A , 2 ), nb do i0 = 1 , size ( A , 1 ), nb do i = i0 , min ( i0 + nb - 1 , int ( size ( A , 1 ), ip )) do j = j0 , min ( j0 + nb - 1 , int ( size ( A , 2 ), ip )) B ( j , i ) = A ( i , j ) end do end do end do end do end subroutine transpose_into","tags":"","url":"proc/transpose_into.html"},{"title":"daqp_refresh_soft_weights – daqp-fortran","text":"public  subroutine daqp_refresh_soft_weights(work) Refactor the working set after a change of the weights of the soft\nconstraints (upstream's daqp_refresh_soft_weights ). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace Calls proc~~daqp_refresh_soft_weights~~CallsGraph proc~daqp_refresh_soft_weights daqp_refresh_soft_weights proc~daqp_activate_constraints daqp_activate_constraints proc~daqp_refresh_soft_weights->proc~daqp_activate_constraints proc~daqp_eq_install daqp_eq_install proc~daqp_refresh_soft_weights->proc~daqp_eq_install proc~daqp_eq_restore daqp_eq_restore proc~daqp_refresh_soft_weights->proc~daqp_eq_restore proc~daqp_reset_workspace daqp_reset_workspace proc~daqp_refresh_soft_weights->proc~daqp_reset_workspace proc~has~2 has proc~daqp_refresh_soft_weights->proc~has~2 proc~is_hierarchical is_hierarchical proc~daqp_refresh_soft_weights->proc~is_hierarchical proc~daqp_activate_constraints->proc~has~2 proc~activate_constraint activate_constraint proc~daqp_activate_constraints->proc~activate_constraint proc~compute_singular_direction compute_singular_direction proc~daqp_activate_constraints->proc~compute_singular_direction proc~drop_singular_last drop_singu