ype Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine spawn_children ( work , node , branch_id ) type ( daqp_workspace ), intent ( inout ) :: work !! workspace integer ( ip ), intent ( in ) :: node !! node integer ( ip ), intent ( in ) :: branch_id !! constraint to branch over call save_warmstart ( work , node ) associate ( tree => work % bnb % tree ) ! child 1 (reuses the current node) tree ( node )% bin_id = toggle_lower_flag ( branch_id ) tree ( node )% depth = tree ( node )% depth + 1 ! child 2 tree ( node + 1 )% bin_id = branch_id tree ( node + 1 )% depth = tree ( node )% depth tree ( node + 1 )% ws_start = tree ( node )% ws_start tree ( node + 1 )% ws_end = tree ( node )% ws_end end associate work % bnb % n_nodes = work % bnb % n_nodes + 2 end subroutine spawn_children","tags":"","url":"proc/spawn_children.html"},{"title":"node_cleanup_workspace – daqp-fortran","text":"private  subroutine node_cleanup_workspace(work, n_clean) Restore the working set to its first n_clean constraints. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace integer(kind=ip), intent(in) :: n_clean constraints to keep Calls proc~~node_cleanup_workspace~~CallsGraph proc~node_cleanup_workspace node_cleanup_workspace proc~has~2 has proc~node_cleanup_workspace->proc~has~2 Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Called by proc~~node_cleanup_workspace~~CalledByGraph proc~node_cleanup_workspace node_cleanup_workspace proc~daqp_bnb daqp_bnb proc~daqp_bnb->proc~node_cleanup_workspace proc~process_node process_node proc~daqp_bnb->proc~process_node proc~process_node->proc~node_cleanup_workspace proc~setup_cold_bnb setup_cold_bnb proc~process_node->proc~setup_cold_bnb proc~setup_cold_bnb->proc~node_cleanup_workspace proc~daqp_solve daqp_solve proc~daqp_solve->proc~daqp_bnb proc~daqp_quadprog daqp_quadprog proc~daqp_quadprog->proc~daqp_solve proc~solve daqp_type%solve proc~solve->proc~daqp_solve proc~daqp_avi daqp_avi proc~daqp_avi->proc~daqp_quadprog Help Graph Key Nodes of different colours represent the following: Graph Key Subroutine Subroutine Function Function Interface Interface Type Bound Procedure Type Bound Procedure Unknown Procedure Type Unknown Procedure Type Program Program This Page's Entity This Page's Entity Solid arrows point from a procedure to one which it calls. Dashed \narrows point from an interface to procedures which implement that interface.\nThis could include the module procedures in a generic interface or the\nimplementation in a submodule of an interface in a parent module. Source Code subroutine node_cleanup_workspace ( work , n_clean ) type ( daqp_workspace ), intent ( inout ) :: work !! workspace integer ( ip ), intent ( in ) :: n_clean !! constraints to keep integer ( ip ) :: i , id do i = n_clean + 1 , work % n_active id = work % WS ( i ) if ( has ( work % sense ( id ), daqp_binary )) then work % sense ( id ) = iand ( work % sense ( id ), not ( daqp_active + daqp_immutable )) else work % sense ( id ) = iand ( work % sense ( id ), not ( daqp_active )) end if end do work % sing_ind = empty_ind work % n_active = n_clean ! only the retained prefix can still have a valid cached substitution if ( work % reuse_ind > n_clean ) work % reuse_ind = n_clean end subroutine node_cleanup_workspace","tags":"","url":"proc/node_cleanup_workspace.html"},{"title":"warmstart_node – daqp-fortran","text":"private  subroutine warmstart_node(work, node) Warm start a node: its fixed constraints, then its stored working set. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace integer(kind=ip), intent(in) :: node node Calls proc~~warmstart_node~~CallsGraph proc~warmstart_node warmstart_node proc~add_upper_lower add_upper_lower proc~warmstart_node->proc~add_upper_lower proc~bnb_load_ws bnb_load_ws proc~warmstart_node->proc~bnb_load_ws proc~remove_lower_flag remove_lower_flag proc~warmstart_node->proc~remove_lower_flag proc~add_upper_lower->proc~remove_lower_flag proc~add_constraint add_constraint proc~add_upper_lower->proc~add_constraint proc~extract_lower_flag extract_lower_flag proc~add_upper_lower->proc~extract_lower_flag proc~bnb_load_ws->proc~add_upper_lower proc~add_constraint_keep_slack add_constraint_keep_slack proc~add_constraint->proc~add_constraint_keep_slack proc~has~2 has proc~add_constraint->proc~has~2 proc~soft_w soft_w proc~add_constraint->proc~soft_w proc~add_constraint_keep_slack->proc~has~2 proc~pivot_last pivot_last proc~add_constraint_keep_slack->proc~pivot_last proc~soft_rho soft_rho proc~add_constraint_keep_slack->proc~soft_rho proc~update_ldl_add update_LDL_add proc~add_constraint_keep_slack->proc~update_ldl_add proc~soft_w->proc~has~2 proc~pivot_last->proc~add_constraint_keep_slack proc~pivot_last->proc~has~2 proc~remove_constraint remove_constraint proc~pivot_last->proc~remove_constraint proc~soft_rho->proc~has~2 proc~update_ldl_add->proc~has~2 proc~row_dot row_dot proc~update_ldl_add->proc~row_dot proc~row_elem row_elem proc~update_ldl_add->proc~row_elem proc~remove_constraint->proc~pivot