mplete the inverse of the factor of the Hessian of the problem in the workspace. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace Return Value logical private  function get_proximal_regularization (work) result(eps) The proximal regularization that the factor of H was formed with. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(in) :: work workspace Return Value real(kind=wp) private  function update_M (work) result(flag) Form M = A*Rinv (rows normalized). Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace Return Value integer(kind=ip) private  function check_bounds (work) result(do_activate) Check the bounds for trivial infeasibility, and detect equality constraints\n(equal bounds). Returns 1 if the working set has to be activated again,\n0, or daqp_exit_infeasible . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace Return Value integer(kind=ip) private  function normalize_M (work) result(flag) Normalize the general constraints of the LDP. Returns 0 or daqp_exit_infeasible . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace Return Value integer(kind=ip) private  function check_unconstrained (work, mask) result(flag) Check whether the unconstrained optimum is feasible (and hence the solution). Read more… Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace integer(kind=ip), intent(in) :: mask update mask Return Value integer(kind=ip) private  function update_ldp_core (mask_in, work) result(flag) Form the LDP of the problem that is in the workspace (the reduced problem\nof an equality elimination is passed here as it is), as marked by mask_in . Returns 0, or a negative exit flag. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name integer(kind=ip), intent(in) :: mask_in the parts to update ( daqp_update_* ) type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace Return Value integer(kind=ip) public  function daqp_update_ldp (work, mask_in) result(flag) Update the workspace with (changes in) the problem in work%qp , as marked\nby mask_in (upstream's daqp_update_ldp ). If the equality constraints are\nto be eliminated, the LDP is formed for the reduced problem, and the\nworkspace keeps describing the original problem otherwise.\nReturns 0, or a negative exit flag. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace integer(kind=ip), intent(in) :: mask_in the parts to update ( daqp_update_* ) Return Value integer(kind=ip) private pure function violates_hard (work) Whether the QP solution in x violates a hard constraint by more than primal_tol . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(in) :: work workspace Return Value logical private pure function prox_is_infeasible (work) Whether the certificate of infeasibility from daqp_ldp (the dependency lam_star of a singular working set) is valid and implies a violation above primal_tol . Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(in) :: work workspace Return Value logical private  function prox_project_step (work, eps) Project the latest proximal step onto the active face (the steepest descent\ndirection on the face, in the metric of H+E ), stored as x-xold .\nReturns false if no projection was done. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspace real(kind=wp), intent(in) :: eps the regularization Return Value logical private  function prox_curvature_step (work) result(step) Step length -g'd/d'Hd that minimizes the objective along d = x-xold ( d in xldl ). Returns daqp_inf if d has no curvature, -1 if d is not\na descent direction. Arguments Type Intent Optional Attributes Name type( daqp_workspace ), intent(inout) :: work workspac